      "id": "mem_flow",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 1490,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "write path (async, ngoài critical path): distill (MEMORY_MODEL — model nhẹ) → embed → pgvector",
      "originalText": "write path (async, ngoài critical path): distill (MEMORY_MODEL — model nhẹ) → embed → pgvector",
